==Advanced Cyclone Stages==
'''Advanced Cyclone Stages''' are a group of maps appearing two times a month for two days each. They consist of one normal stage followed by a [[Continuation Stage]] with 1 Epic [[Catfruit]] as a reward; clearing the Continuation Stage causes the map to disappear until its next appearance, but before [[Version 10.7 Update|version 10.7]] they could be replayed infinitely, yielding 1 [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]] for each clear. They are all unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.
