==Cyclonefest==
[[File:Yearend 2020 img03 en.png|center|700px]]
:''●Cyclonefest!''
:''Put on your raincoat, board up your windows and get ready for Cyclonefest!''
:''Get to the Stories of Legend/Event Stages to take on the Cyclone stages as they all become available during this limited-time event! Odd Days and Even Days will feature different Cyclone challenge maps.''
:''Clear any Cyclone stage for a chance to unlock awesome limited edition Cats and collect useful items!''
:''※ Regularly appearing Cyclone stages will also appear at their scheduled times.''
:''※ Some stages may not appear based on how for you have advanced in the Story Mode chapters.''

'''Cyclonefest''' is a limited event that was added in 2017. During this event, half of the Cyclone Stages and Cyclone Cats' Awakening Stages are available at once on even days, with the other half available on odd days. It appears from December 26th to December 31st.

Even days: [[Attack on R-Cyclone (Expert)|Crimson Catastrophe]], [[Crimson Vengeance]], [[Attack on W-Cyclone (Expert)|Peerless]], [[Peerless Too]], [[Attack on Titanium (Insane)|Sweet Irony]], [[Bitter Irony]], [[Oncoming Storm (Insane)|Red Sky at Morning]], [[Red Sky at Night]], [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The 2nd Dimension]], [[The 3rd Dimension]]

Odd days: [[Attack on D-Cyclone (Expert)|Heaven of Darkness]], [[NEO Darkness Heaven]], [[Oncoming Maelstrom (Expert)|Wrath of Heaven]], [[Wrath of the Divine]], [[Black Hole Rising (Insane)|Dimension of Despair]], [[Dimension of Delirium]], [[Unholy Tempest (Insane)|The Rolling Dead]], [[The Dead Keep Rolling]], [[Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)|Typhoon Nemo]], [[Typhoon Nihil]]

